&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GenAI/Agent Engineering &lt;/strong&gt;that is essential to the enterprise agent strategy – MCP, RAG, embeddings/vector search, tool calling, agent architecture, evaluation, grounding, orchestration. Architect and govern the Enterprise Agentic AI Strategy, deploying multi-agent frameworks and LLM-powered tools at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
