&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Expert OKTA architecture and identity-platform design.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Federation, SCIM, OAuth/OIDC and API access management.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Zero-trust and identity-security architecture.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Integration design across complex application estates.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Architecture documentation and design-authority experience.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Recognised architecture experience in the relevant domain at enterprise scale.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Relevant architecture or platform certifications (e.g. TOGAF or vendor architect tracks).&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Degree in a relevant discipline or equivalent experience.• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Sets the target architecture, standards and design patterns for the domain.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Designs for security, scale, resilience and total cost of ownership.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Influences engineering and vendor teams without direct authority.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Balances strategic ambition with pragmatic, deliverable decisions.&lt;br&gt;• &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Stays current with platform direction and emerging capability.&lt;/p&gt;
